{"event":"step_update","step_update":{"conversation_id":"b8d63e99-1280-4b90-bbc7-16033b0cd429","step_index":134,"state":"DONE","step_type":"tool","tool_name":"run_command","duration_seconds":2.616772,"tool_info":{"name":"run_command","parameters":{"CommandLine":"python3 -c '\nimport re\nfor step in [\"37\", \"51\"]:\n    p = f\"/Users/valentinakoniukhova/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/b8d63e99-1280-4b90-bbc7-16033b0cd429/.system_generated/steps/{step}/content.md\"\n    txt = open(p).read()\n    print(f\"=== STEP {step} ===\")\n    for m in re.finditer(r\"([^\\n\u003c\u003e]{0,100}(?:workout_doc|hr_ceiling|LTHR|description)[^\\n\u003c\u003e]{0,100})\", txt):\n        print(m.group(1))\n'"},"output":"\u003ctruncated 72 lines\u003e\n\":\"DELETION\",\"blobLineNumber\":138,\"text\":\"-Open, and answerable only by looking at a watch: does a `workout_doc`-delivered ceiling arrive as an enforced target? If it does not, the honest options are a `% LTHR` \r\nat a watch: does a \\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-c1\\\"\\u003eworkout_doc\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e-delivered ceiling arrive as an en\r\nst options are a \\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-c1\\\"\\u003e% LTHR\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e range (documented, parsed, proces\r\ntype\":\"ADDITION\",\"blobLineNumber\":136,\"text\":\"+This was, at the time, read as a reason to keep the `workout_doc` write: workout text cannot express an absolute BPM ceiling at all, and the alternative looked like\r\nreason to keep the \\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-c1\\\"\\u003eworkout_doc\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e write: workout text cannot expres\r\non\":28,\"left\":141,\"right\":139},{\"type\":\"HUNK\",\"blobLineNumber\":150,\"text\":\"@@ -153,19 +151,40 @@ A `workout_doc` carrying `hr: {units: \\\"bpm\\\", start: 0, end: 140}` reaches the wa\",\"html\":\"@@ -153,19 +151,40 @@ \r\nA `workout_doc` carrying `hr: {units: \\u0026quot;bpm\\u0026quot;, start: 0, end: 140}` reaches the wa\",\"displayNoNe\r\n},{\"type\":\"ADDITION\",\"blobLineNumber\":156,\"text\":\"+Unverified, noticed in passing: the pace probe's description carried `6:05-6:20/km` and the athlete read the watch step as `6:10`. Either Garmin collapses a pac\r\nkout is on a watch (issue #21).\",\"html\":\"+Unverified, noticed in passing: the pace probe\\u0026#39;s description carried \\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-c1\\\"\\u003e6:05-6:20/\r\nt\":156,\"right\":159},{\"type\":\"ADDITION\",\"blobLineNumber\":160,\"text\":\"+On the same probe day, `50-86% LTHR` written as workout text arrived on the watch as **81-140 bpm** against a Run threshold HR of 163. \r\n probe day, \\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-c1\\\"\\u003e50-86% LTHR\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e written as workout text arrived o\r\n},{\"type\":\"DELETION\",\"blobLineNumber\":158,\"text\":\"-Unverified, noticed in passing: the pace probe's description carried `6:05-6:20/km` and the athlete read the watch step as `6:10`. Either Garmin collapses a pac\r\ne a pace workout is on a watch.\",\"html\":\"-Unverified, noticed in passing: the pace probe\\u0026#39;s description carried \\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-c1\\\"\\u003e6:05-6:20/\r\n46,\"left\":158,\"right\":165},{\"type\":\"ADDITION\",\"blobLineNumber\":166,\"text\":\"+| workout text, `50-86% LTHR` | `hr: {units: \\\"%lthr\\\", start: 50, end: 86}` | 18 | computed |\",\"html\":\"+\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-m\r\nrkout text, \\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-c1\\\"\\u003e50-86% LTHR\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e \\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-ml\\\"\\u003e|\r\nlute pace via workout text (the control: does *any* structured target reach the watch?) and `70-83% LTHR` via workout text (the candidate replacement, expected around 114-135 bpm against a 163 bpm thresho\r\nwatch?) and \\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-c1\\\"\\u003e70-83% LTHR\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e via workout text (the candidate r\r\ng\":false,\"position\":53,\"left\":160,\"right\":171},{\"type\":\"ADDITION\",\"blobLineNumber\":172,\"text\":\"+- `_hr_ceiling_workout_doc` and every outbound supplied `workout_doc` are gone. `_provider_payload` emits workout \r\n\\u003c/span\\u003e \\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-c1\\\"\\u003e_hr_ceiling_workout_doc\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e and every outbound su\r\npplied \\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-c1\\\"\\u003eworkout_doc\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e are gone. \\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\r\n\"type\":\"ADDITION\",\"blobLineNumber\":173,\"text\":\"+- The ceiling stays canonical in bpm in PlanState. `hr_ceiling_percent_lthr` converts it, choosing the **largest** whole percent that still resolves at or under t\r\n bpm in PlanState. \\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-c1\\\"\\u003ehr_ceiling_percent_lthr\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e converts it, choosin\r\nng\":false,\"position\":77,\"left\":204,\"right\":223},{\"type\":\"DELETION\",\"blobLineNumber\":205,\"text\":\"-- `workout_doc` is an Intervals-specific narrow workaround;\",\"html\":\"-\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-v\\\"\\u003e-\\u003c/span\\\r\nu003e \\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-c1\\\"\\u003eworkout_doc\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e is \\u003cspan class=\\\"x x-first x\r\nng\":false,\"position\":78,\"left\":205,\"right\":223},{\"type\":\"ADDITION\",\"blobLineNumber\":224,\"text\":\"+- `workout_doc` is read-back only, never a supplied payload;\",\"html\":\"+\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-v\\\"\\u003e-\\u003c/span\r\n\\u003e \\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-c1\\\"\\u003eworkout_doc\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e`\\u003c/span\\u003e is \\u003cspan class=\\\"x x-first x\r\n,\"left\":1988,\"right\":1988},{\"type\":\"CONTEXT\",\"blobLineNumber\":1989,\"text\":\"               delivered_description:\",\"html\":\"               \\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-ent\\\"\\u003edelivered_description\\u003c/span\\u003e:\",\r\nsition\":3,\"left\":1990,\"right\":1990},{\"type\":\"ADDITION\",\"blobLineNumber\":1991,\"text\":\"+              hr_ceiling_resolution:\",\"html\":\"+              \\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-ent\\\"\\u003ehr_ceiling_resolution\\u003c/sp\r\ntion\":5,\"left\":1990,\"right\":1992},{\"type\":\"ADDITION\",\"blobLineNumber\":1993,\"text\":\"+                description: \\u003e-\",\"html\":\"+                \\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-ent\\\"\\u003edescription\\u003c/span\\u003e: \\\r\nbLineNumber\":1996,\"text\":\"+                  threshold HR, so the delivered text reads e.g. `50-86% LTHR`. Show\",\"html\":\"+\\u003cspan class=\\\"pl-s\\\"\\u003e                  threshold HR, so the delivered te\r\nxt reads e.g. `50-86% LTHR`. Show\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"displayNoNewLineWarning\":false,\"position\":9,\"left\":1990,\"right\":1996},{\"t\r\nspan class=\"ws-pre-wrap extended-commit-description-container f6 wb-break-word text-mono mt-2 prc-Text-Text-9mHv3\" data-component=\"Text\"\r\nAn absolute-bpm ceiling supplied through `workout_doc` read back byte-exact\r\n`% LTHR` is the one encoding the provider parses, analyses and exports intact:\r\nagainst a Run threshold HR of 163, `50-86% LTHR` reached the watch as 81-140\r\ncarries a supplied `workout_doc` at all.\r\n% LTHR\r\n\"description\"\r\nn merely undocumented. Two rules this schema cannot express are enforced by validate_plan_state: an hr_ceiling target may not appear inside a repeat, and one workout may not mix pace and hr_ceiling targets.\r\n\"description\"\r\n. Two rules this schema cannot express are enforced by validate_plan_state: an hr_ceiling target may not appear inside a repeat, and one workout may not mix pace and hr_ceiling targets.\r\n@@ -46,7 +46,7 @@ Intervals also returns a structured `workout_doc` when planned workouts are read\r\nworkout_doc\r\nworkout_doc\r\nworkout_doc\r\nworkout_doc\r\nworkout_doc\r\nworkout_doc\r\nworkout_doc\r\n{low}-{high}% LTHR\r\nworkout_doc\r\nworkout_doc\r\nworkout_doc\r\n% LTHR\r\nworkout_doc\r\n@@ -153,19 +151,40 @@ A `workout_doc` carrying `hr: {units: \u0026quot;bpm\u0026quot;, start: 0, end: 140}` reaches the wa\r\nUnverified, noticed in passing: the pace probe\u0026#39;s description carried \r\n50-86% LTHR\r\nUnverified, noticed in passing: the pace probe\u0026#39;s description carried \r\n50-86% LTHR\r\n70-83% LTHR\r\n_hr_ceiling_workout_doc\r\nworkout_doc\r\nhr_ceiling_percent_lthr\r\nworkout_doc\r\nworkout_doc\r\ndelivered_description\r\nhr_ceiling_resolution\r\ndescription\r\n                  threshold HR, so the delivered text reads e.g. `50-86% LTHR`. Show\r\n"}}}
